{"id":"aef862f28dead7fd","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-families-of-languages.md","title":"以自然数字母编码的语言族","display":"df-families-of-languages — 以自然数字母编码的语言族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-families-of-languages","aliases":["73-df-families-of-languages"],"display":"df-families-of-languages — 以自然数字母编码的语言族","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§11.1, p. 270; scan 278; local set-sized alphabet convention","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§11.1, p. 270; scan 278; local set-sized alphabet convention","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-families-of-languages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-families-of-languages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-families-of-languages — 以自然数字母编码的语言族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.1, p. 270; scan 278; local set-sized alphabet convention"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§11.1, p. 270; scan 278; local set-sized alphabet convention"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 作为可用字符的背景载体；空词不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，有限序列约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为候选集合。这里只固定本章语言族的集合大小表示，任意有限字母表可经双射重命名到此载体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathbb N:0&lt;|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak L\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\;L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathbb N:0&lt;|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak L\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\;L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathcal F\\;L\\ne\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathcal F\\;L\\ne\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>依原书，族须含至少一个非空语言；仅含空语言的 {∅} 不能作为这里的语言族。固定可数字符载体后，族是集合，避免无界地把任意标签的所有语言量化为一个集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"用 $\\mathbb N$ 作为可用字符的背景载体；空词不属于 $\\mathbb N$，有限序列约定见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。$\\mathcal F$ 为候选集合。这里只固定本章语言族的集合大小表示，任意有限字母表可经双射重命名到此载体。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathbb N:0<|\\Sigma|<\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak L\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}:\\exists\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\;L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}families\\text{-}of\\text{-}languages}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathcal F\\;L\\ne\\varnothing","display":true}],"bytes":2081,"backlinks":[{"id":"23b25eb6ccba1a53","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数字母范围 $\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak L$ 见 [[73-df-families-of-languages]]。各固定字母表语言类见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"481adbebb0f51a94","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak L$ 与 $\\operatorname{Family}$ 见 [[73-df-families-of-languages]]；$\\operatorname{Hom},\\operatorname{Nonerasing}$ 和像/原像见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；正则类见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。下面各子式中重新量化的字母表与同态均为独立局部绑定。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-335","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-families-of-languages|以自然数字母编码的语言族]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}